Maintainer: Omaxian OS <dev@omaxian.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake, scdoc
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/ReimuNotMoe/ydotool
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: omaxian-ydotool
Architecture: amd64
Depends: kmod, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: ydotool
Conflicts: ydotool
Replaces: ydotool
Description: generic command-line automation tool (ydotool, Omaxian build)
 ydotool 1.0.4 built from the upstream source (github.com/ReimuNotMoe/ydotool,
 pinned tag, commit and sha256): /usr/bin/ydotool and /usr/bin/ydotoold.
 Omaxian integration (sysvinit, X11/i3, no systemd user unit):
  * /dev/uinput is group "input", mode 0660 (udev rule); uinput is loaded at
    boot (modules-load.d); installed users are in the "input" group;
  * ~/.local/bin/ydotoold -> /usr/bin/ydotoold and an i3 autostart line
    (~/.config/i3/config.d/50-ydotool.conf), seeded once per user.
